                        "review": "This was the first game I completed entirely in VR.  I was new and the controls didn't bother me and the experience was really cool.  After playing in VR for years and coming back to Scanner Sombre the game's controls really turned me off.   But I like the game so I made a SmoothVR mod for it so it feels more modern.  \r\n\r\nThe audio and atmosphere of this game in VR are unlike any other VR game I have played.  And enthusiasts would like the experience if they could get past the outdated and limited controls.  Hopefully my mod does some small part in fixing that issue.\r\n\r\nI made a post about it in the discussion forums here on steam if you want a link to the mod.",
